   (`gemini_wsâ†’gemini`, `wavespeed_webhookâ†’webhook`, `wavespeed_directâ†’direct`, `grok_automaâ†’grok`,
   `kie_aiâ†’kie-ai`) plus the legacy-alias branches in `app.py:253-276`.
