| 7 â€” Triggers & automation | 7.1â€“7.5 (5) | 7.1 (queue) must land first; 7.2/7.3/7.4 parallel after it |
| 8 â€” Node developer kit | 8.1â€“8.4 (4) | 8.2/8.3 parallel after 8.1; 8.4 last |
